    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A non-owning view over a contiguous tensor buffer. <computeroutput><ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__optim_1_1OptimTensor" kindref="compound">OptimTensor</ref></computeroutput> never allocates: the caller is responsible for the lifetime of the underlying memory referenced by <computeroutput>data</computeroutput>. The shape may contain symbolic dimensions which is useful for representing intermediate values during optimisation passes where the concrete shape is not yet known. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
